iagnostic variants of the same activity. The smallest executable version is minimal in mechanism, not narrow in scope.","output":[{"type":"reasoning","id":"rs_0e13f90584c345af016b089bafe04887d18bc4a4b03dc4f74a","summary":[],"content":[],"encrypted_content":"gAAAAABrCJuwqBZhLotvVrCNpj4hTU-zmeGibKQI4x_jgeJHZZTtlHTdKfDVA-KPXn2VYSirepflloAiKL3DI8WfGoFw_YPkTBzIn9QkucgN56ZiXsrARvc3xS7zz6jNMjHQ-TxoQizjIDumillkyluwgyp7mPB8PC1buOtrqutKLVyUXnhlmDq3AmhwbRePm6RHZJla4v5sV9c0aAyTqvBCnwiXi6ClfKlcncQz-9ogRaViyvX4V_C0aT0qRIj4Z9zwDUw20JQNh3Lo-07lOich9H2h1LmeH7MyG7dsseJq9xsjQ2jBhkGgy7Vlg9ZlTxkneLcfUdYJh2dgxQ36LYLXKiW538Z8y5TsVNX4eXvKl7nuxcy2mfDGblGpwD9VwP9ZjH0khamf3fIWpC-rlqg6_ud1y9bXG0ccMuEUCWZ-w89Tc8MsqrlOejcz-2dygVU54XQKxxoU67OujfWWjmoneAmlbrZnR3hxyk21jZ-MSHgQr5zhTgKW30VxKbkbyRbuuKLowpl3nuwx__v2DORdnPw7DIFXgfoEgaohMhIHLzCEvV1-Y9sTZMx3r2yO79gt6qfq6XvSdI1wl5O8nT9sZlaPJzxKh7WdPKHtUZu1kgAXQFsTEg8H3lkFxkTJu31Sofz30rCGtBA_RueO3f6oh-gMumWN7ngvxq3Bbawq7NgLjG0-oZimKfvMrH0mpHB-Mduvhl6gd1fDphlz2uZ6F1CfQCPZiGOiEWGqQ4U6x0EVH8jzMvLBNA74g4NeFPkTpArtomU8AkkfvCSN0efZaudblDo-fDhZ_2TnXRB3QZeS_JReqZatTpb3xYLzw3BmKigzmBjHAc063ijDOwf2D8sHyaUFXzkcVX7uwJga1WODVlJTGqXmggJndOz-ywIVQl1HNd-vWWis1aeBEwgwMOY8Cirpo-ADUDo2Ycqe5m4y4J1ze11jPGngY4iMyDWauhvBk0REu5ov0hZJ3Oky2WJV2jZvJbwoCcc640im0zAoptn5QPBITkXESRaskt0Rg8Ho7f1nJDTFuLz2nvvRcFig59x81waGevm_ljojdOiy9yvsQH731SKWKDlk97hmH_L86d6b-5oK2H65TPlljqqvQLKFVk_5zjMOM-_oJWjBM2XtNBhzh4c5VUkUepoA9L_IiXNpTJHD-kUmJ9ikE8b1lXHBGzkMiN2-dmFJDTrSiOv8Re6ztKnNyIDQv92gCwWeMpMGJEroOwoErqAJzqI27eK0qYWPinmojTs8FzYPhXN0vgZNaDGP-aSB8tlfBdxsgRilIh_HTOrKsVfS1-2uVSGAwbMGBmMhT8JxlnmScxqlrV9LUSIuC0rT84GCRY5GdAcyZiVb_FWMFD-G15p8zOjDn_1gUk2o_QWWldcR2I9FA0_TsVQSL43m3bYsTNbR4BmO0tw4AhS8PdcgatXh_loCsbf78yw_co11xLvmo0E3vMuNNWONe-9MpUblgrtv4dDuEHd_V-vsF3hceBtNc8s6pVbjCqJDAi4QTxxWBXkQ4DSsPgb_8D3nQIT5uSvzOcJ9pOzYgIW7cZ0vcw71LALIadgpE4HUlfZIabDkhJhk6GR8DjmI3XYHkukFwPlaD2iwytpi2fUKb37OFNIPyRToLZZ8-lLclqNI0jLcqul2HhkBIPx43F7hh3GK-X1bWw8_pwDaB3StYPEP-AVt00g9shQGqEK0oYfyvi-_xcqpKwBXEgD_PNpYn-Y89qA2hcjpV9